    "name": "Hold Your King",
    "steam_appid": 3564340,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/a26a890bc6df730642d360a251cd548c.avif?t=1755313545\" width=462 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold Your King\u00a0</strong>is a physics-based co-op platformer set in a stylized medieval world full of parkours, dangers, and coordination. Trust your friend and carry the king to throne room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom is under siege. A powerful cannonball strikes the royal balcony, launching the stubborn old king right into the corner of the realm at the feet of two very confused players. Injured? Perhaps. Humble? Never.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>He barks his royal command: <br><strong>&quot;Carry me! Take me to my throne\u2026 Now!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment on, the madness begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Your mission: <strong>carry the king through parkours, dodge the ballista arrows, boulders, cannon balls and many more without dropping him.</strong> But staying balanced and keeping healthy communication under pressure is easier said than done. If he falls, you fall too (and probably your friendship).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>DON'T LOSE YOUR BALANCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/a0aec64e0af6da3523422ef69723d213.poster.avif?t=1755313545\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/a0aec64e0af6da3523422ef69723d213.webm?t=1755313545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/a0aec64e0af6da3523422ef69723d213.mp4?t=1755313545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of physics while carrying the King! Your speed, acceleration, and angular momentum directly affect his balance. Every step you take decides the King\u2019s fate and therefore yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 MAKE USE OF YOUR LIMBS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/0c7dd933b29749310f77dfa87428e54f.poster.avif?t=1755313545\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/0c7dd933b29749310f77dfa87428e54f.webm?t=1755313545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/0c7dd933b29749310f77dfa87428e54f.mp4?t=1755313545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keeping the King balanced is up to you! Lift the stretcher up or down, rotate it left or right, and use physics to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 PASS THROUGH VARIOUS STAGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/26655e51af76354ce3f589ec77905359.poster.avif?t=1755313545\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/26655e51af76354ce3f589ec77905359.webm?t=1755313545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/26655e51af76354ce3f589ec77905359.mp4?t=1755313545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry the King through uniquely crafted, parkours! Each step brings a new challenge to conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/a26a890bc6df730642d360a251cd548c.avif?t=1755313545\" width=462 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold Your King\u00a0</strong>is a physics-based co-op platformer set in a stylized medieval world full of parkours, dangers, and coordination. Trust your friend and carry the king to throne room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom is under siege. A powerful cannonball strikes the royal balcony, launching the stubborn old king right into the corner of the realm at the feet of two very confused players. Injured? Perhaps. Humble? Never.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>He barks his royal command: <br><strong>&quot;Carry me! Take me to my throne\u2026 Now!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment on, the madness begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Your mission: <strong>carry the king through parkours, dodge the ballista arrows, boulders, cannon balls and many more without dropping him.</strong> But staying balanced and keeping healthy communication under pressure is easier said than done. If he falls, you fall too (and probably your friendship).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>DON'T LOSE YOUR BALANCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/a0aec64e0af6da3523422ef69723d213.poster.avif?t=1755313545\" width=568 hei